=== Text #6 ===
> [Want] to volunteer in the classroom?
You can email me here, or fill out the form.
Communication and caretaker involvement are so important[ to] me! Research shows how important it is to have caretaker volunteers in the classroom - it's helpful for me, the school, the students, and you. Learn more about why in this Education.com article!
You know your child better than anyone else, so it's essential that we work together. If you can't volunteer in the classroom, I'd still love to get to know you. You and your child have a wealth of knowledge that I can learn from. I always strive to make my classroom as culturally responsive as possible, so learning about your specific culture is so important[ to] me. Feel free to contact me via the button below.
